{"4188320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Seven Elemental Vases", "steam_appid": 4188320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Seven Elemental Vases</strong> is a 2D platformer semi-RPG where you can find a lot of characters with a deep history about the gods and humans kingdoms. With bosses, puzzles, upgrades and of course, secrets to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/a089d9e9fe1b6eccaa83f5e3cfced8d7.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Main History.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Mike, the Michael's son. Your father is obsessed with relics and one day he learned about a legend. &quot;If someone obtains the seven elemental vases in the same place, he will be able to manipulate the world, destroying and creating without restrictions.&quot; After that and knowing the type of idea your father can have about that power, you decide to stop him from his plans, with the help of Samanta, the goodness of sand, traveling among different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore deserts, woods, jungles and a lot more like dungeons, that are filled with ancient enemies like lamias, spirits and... skeletons? Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/5a6a550b7321f13a4186fc1588e22e08.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lateral displacement platform, with the essential movement mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system with illustrations for each relevant character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various scenarios with their own ambient and functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against memorable bosses, others more hidden...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subplots that unfold mysteries to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging game modes upon completing the main story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more content will arrive over time in the form of free updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/460f3ff772482b7c95c1924ca84b7b86.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Configuration Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to two languages ​​available, English and Spanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High contrast text.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable damage registration caused or not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these options are configurable at any time during the game, except for the controls, which require remaining in the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/4e768b24a326e490d7cb3914a9bdb1cc.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Seven Elemental Vases</strong> is a 2D platformer semi-RPG where you can find a lot of characters with a deep history about the gods and humans kingdoms. With bosses, puzzles, upgrades and of course, secrets to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/a089d9e9fe1b6eccaa83f5e3cfced8d7.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Main History.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Mike, the Michael's son. Your father is obsessed with relics and one day he learned about a legend. &quot;If someone obtains the seven elemental vases in the same place, he will be able to manipulate the world, destroying and creating without restrictions.&quot; After that and knowing the type of idea your father can have about that power, you decide to stop him from his plans, with the help of Samanta, the goodness of sand, traveling among different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore deserts, woods, jungles and a lot more like dungeons, that are filled with ancient enemies like lamias, spirits and... skeletons? Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/5a6a550b7321f13a4186fc1588e22e08.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lateral displacement platform, with the essential movement mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system with illustrations for each relevant character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various scenarios with their own ambient and functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against memorable bosses, others more hidden...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subplots that unfold mysteries to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging game modes upon completing the main story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more content will arrive over time in the form of free updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/460f3ff772482b7c95c1924ca84b7b86.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Configuration Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to two languages ​​available, English and Spanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High contrast text.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable damage registration caused or not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these options are configurable at any time during the game, except for the controls, which require remaining in the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/extras/4e768b24a326e490d7cb3914a9bdb1cc.webp?t=1775617592\" width=339 height=42 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Explore the world in its various biomes, fight magical enemies, meet gods and legends, while trying to prevent your father from obtaining the seven elemental vases in this retro-style story, where gods and humans meet again, thanks to the help of a simple mortal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/ac1fbf7d9d36975765d8dd41db61438fa343204c/header.jpg?t=1775617592", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/43cfe84e3749520fba84e65a1949f517b351d75d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775617592", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188320/43cfe84e3749520fba84e65a1949f517b351d75d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775617592", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 / AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li>